{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And he shall present it as a sin-offering.</b> The lot makes the goat a sin-offering, as the Sages, of blessed memory, stated (Yoma 39b): ״הַגּוֹרָל עוֹשֶׂה חַטָּאת וְאֵין הַשֵּׁם עוֹשֶׂה חַטָּאת״ — \"The lot designates it as a sin-offering, and the [divine] Name does not designate it as a sin-offering.\""], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:36:28.291764912Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}